Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Site Administration|
		|testray.main.component.name|Site Administration|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Activate Site
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|System Settings|
	When Navigator goto Nav Item
		|navItem|Foundation|
	And SystemSettings edit Configuration
		|configurationName|Inactive Request Handler|
	And SystemSettings enable Setting
		|checkboxSetting|SHOW_INACTIVE_REQUEST_MESSAGE|
	And SystemSettings save Configuration
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Site Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Site Settings|
	And Site inactivate CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page view Inactive Request Message
		|resource|site|
	And User first Login PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site activate Inactive
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then AssertTextNotPresent the value 'This site is inactive. Please contact the administrator.'
Scenario: Add Child Child Site
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|parentSiteName|Site Name|
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|parentSiteName|Child SiteName|
		|siteName|Child Child SiteName|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site view Child CP
		|childSiteName|Child SiteName|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Site view Child CP
		|childSiteName|Child Child SiteName|
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
Scenario: Add Child Site
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
