Scenario: Add Public Virtual Hosts Site URL
Priority: 3
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Pages
		|page|Public Pages|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Public Page|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Site Settings|
	And Site add Virtual Hosts URLCP
		|publicPageVirtualHostURL|www.able.com|
		|publicVirtualHosts|true|
	And Navigator open Specific URL
		|url|http://www.able.com:8080/test-public-page|
	Then Site view Virtual Hosts URLPG
		|pageName|Test Public Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|sitePageURL|http://www.able.com:8080/test-public-page|
Scenario: Add Site
Description: Ensure that the super admin can add a Blank Site
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then Site view CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
