Scenario: Edit Site Friendly URL
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Pages
		|page|Public Pages|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Public Page|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Private Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|sitePagePrivacy|Private|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Site Settings|
	And Site edit Friendly URLCP
		|siteFriendlyURLEdit|alpha|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|alpha|
	And Site view Site Friendly URLPG
		|pageName|Public Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|sitePageURL|${portalURL}/web/alpha|
	And Navigator open Private Site URL
		|siteName|alpha|
	Then Site view Site Friendly URLPG
		|pageName|Private Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|sitePageURL|${portalURL}/group/alpha|
